  m_Text: 'Congratulations, Graduate!


    You have a degree, a fresh resume and
    big dreams. All you need now is a job, so you can start gaining some experience.


    Entry-level
    jobs are made for beginners, so this should be easy. Pick a posting on the Job
    Board and apply!'
